WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,260
Lao Wu

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,800
Aren't you already dead?

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:06,630
I was framed by Su Wan

4
00:00:06,870 --> 00:00:07,910
Almost died

5
00:00:08,230 --> 00:00:09,310
It was the leader who saved me

6
00:00:09,750 --> 00:00:11,710
I just said it’s not like Uncle Wu would do those things.

7
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:13,550
Dashaqing is overestimating his abilities

8
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:14,870
Lead a team to attack the leader

9
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:16,470
I don’t overestimate my abilities either

10
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,110
Want to save him from the leader

11
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:19,650
wake up again

12
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,450
We all become members here

13
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,650
The leader clearly gave us a chance to leave

14
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,860
It was me who ruined the lives of the team members

15
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:32,140
People here also lack actual combat experience, leader

16
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:34,590
You can leave the member training to me in the future.

17
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,310
He does have experience in making new friends.

18
00:00:36,590 --> 00:00:37,790
New people assigned to me before

19
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:39,790
I will also ask him to help take care of Xiaoci

20
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,900
It turns out you were thinking about the newcomers

21
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,190
Part of it is because I'm impatient
